GRUB integration: the bootloader environment scripts come with the tool (never downloaded), the image's
own grub-editenv is used when it has one, a standalone GRUB EFI binary comes from the verified assets,
and every kernel command line gets panic=N (drop-in for the image's GRUB configuration, fragment 12_ in
standalone mode).

